{"obsah":"<p>This time we rode as two teams. Michal Budský and the youngest, Tobík Dolák, headed near Sokolov for a local cycling day that was unfortunately rained out. The guys battled the weather, but of course the weather affects everything. Vlasta, Martin Šimůnek and 3 little ones from the Kabeláč clan set off for the Pražské služby exhibition, where in two shows by the main stage they showed what can and can't be done on bikes. The second show was extended with an exhibition by the parkour guys and a Vlasta vs parkour battle (the result is secret :))</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FIMG_0872-kopie.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FIMG_0872-kopie.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246285\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FIMG_0895-kopie.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FIMG_0895-kopie.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246283\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FIMG_0926-kopie.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FIMG_0926-kopie.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246284\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/